#       from the model''s outline after that pass''s outline stage, per channel.  shape_tilt_deg and shape_offset_um are the rms change
#       of the sides of the stop the pass measured against the stop it was fit with, spread_tilt_deg and spread_offset_um the rms of the
#       channels about the common shape, rotation_deg and scale each channel''s image of the stop against the stop it was fit with.  The
